every point scored this NBA season]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135645630.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/milwaukee-bucks-star-myles-turner-has-joined-a-campaign-promising-250-pet-meals-for-every-point-he-scores-and-1000-for-each-three-pointer-following-a-wnba-players-completed-319750-meal-contribution/articleshow/135645630.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/milwaukee-bucks-star-myles-turner-has-joined-a-campaign-promising-250-pet-meals-for-every-point-he-scores-and-1000-for-each-three-pointer-following-a-wnba-players-completed-319750-meal-contribution/articleshow/135645630.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T12:07:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135645689,imgsize-746762.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Two carpenters save 93-year-old with a dress; grateful wife calls them lifesavers]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135649176.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-elderly-man-fell-while-carrying-breakfast-and-severed-an-artery-two-queensland-carpenters-used-a-dress-and-adhesive-tape-to-save-his-life-leaving-his-wife-overwhelmed-with-gratitude/articleshow/135649176.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/an-elderly-man-fell-while-carrying-breakfast-and-severed-an-artery-two-queensland-carpenters-used-a-dress-and-adhesive-tape-to-save-his-life-leaving-his-wife-overwhelmed-with-gratitude/articleshow/135649176.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T12:05:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135649277,imgsize-1570696.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Weeks after flydubai incident, 'hostile aircraft' alert triggers panic in Israel]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135652438.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An alert regarding a potential hostile aircraft intrusion in northern Israel was issued but later clarified. The alert prompted heightened scrutiny following an attempted hijacking of a flydubai flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv. Israel has introduced tighter screening protocols for airlines in response to security challenges faced. Separately, the Israel Defence Forces discovered over 340 Hezbollah weapons during operations in southern Lebanon.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/weeks-after-flydubai-incident-hostile-aircraft-alert-triggers-panic-in-israel/articleshow/135652438.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/weeks-after-flydubai-incident-hostile-aircraft-alert-triggers-panic-in-israel/articleshow/135652438.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T11:33:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135652898,imgsize-76288.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iran executes 3 men accused of carrying out operations for Israel, US during protests]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135652472.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iran-executes-3-men-accused-of-carrying-out-operations-for-israel-us-during-protests/articleshow/135652472.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/iran-executes-3-men-accused-of-carrying-out-operations-for-israel-us-during-protests/articleshow/135652472.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T11:21:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135652590,imgsize-700781.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Chained to bed, windows covered in foil: How ex-husband held US woman captive for 2 yrs]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135652201.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A woman was found in Fargo after allegedly being chained to a bed for two years and abused. She was discovered after a maintenance worker heard her cries for help in the apartment complex. Her ex-husband and his girlfriend have been charged with kidnapping and other crimes related to her captivity. Investigators revealed she was brought from Mexico and confined under inhumane conditions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/chained-to-bed-windows-covered-in-foil-how-ex-husband-held-us-woman-captive-for-2-years/articleshow/135652201.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/chained-to-bed-windows-covered-in-foil-how-ex-husband-held-us-woman-captive-for-2-years/articleshow/135652201.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T11:04:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135652346,imgsize-486024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[10-year-old Ukrainian boy tracks rare black stork from Chernobyl to Africa to expose threats to its survival]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135602105.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Noah Beshto, a 10-year-old prodigy from Ukraine, embarked on an adventurous journey in a motorhome, tracking the migration of the black stork. Partnering with ornithologist Nika Paposhvili, he documented the hazards these birds face, such as electrocution and destruction of their habitats. Through his captivating series, Noah's Diary, he aspires to motivate children towards wildlife conservation, fostering potential collaborations among environmentalists.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/at-just-10-ukrainian-boy-noah-beshto-turned-wildlife-detective-tracking-a-rare-black-stork-from-chernobyl-to-africa-in-a-motorhome-he-wants-to-save-the-bird-from-deadly-power-lines-poaching-and-habitat-loss/articleshow/135602105.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/at-just-10-ukrainian-boy-noah-beshto-turned-wildlife-detective-tracking-a-rare-black-stork-from-chernobyl-to-africa-in-a-motorhome-he-wants-to-save-the-bird-from-deadly-power-lines-poaching-and-habitat-loss/articleshow/135602105.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T10:55:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135602373,imgsize-659136.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tents Flooded In Gaza Rains: Torrential downpour inundates 70,000 shelters; fuel shortages stall aid]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135651825.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The recent heavy rains have led to catastrophic flooding in temporary shelters for displaced Palestinians across Gaza, impacting countless families. Reports from local authorities indicate that over 70,000 tents were submerged in a mere few hours. The civil defense teams are hampered by fuel shortages and damaged equipment, leaving many residents without proper shelter and enduring severe conditions as the humanitarian crisis deepens amidst ongoing turmoil.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/70000-tents-flooded-in-12-hours-as-heavy-rain-batters-displaced-palestinians-in-gaza/articleshow/135651825.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/70000-tents-flooded-in-12-hours-as-heavy-rain-batters-displaced-palestinians-in-gaza/articleshow/135651825.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T10:38:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135651936,imgsize-139501.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Enemy will no longer dare attack': Iran's navy issues warning to US forces]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135651481.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran’s Northern Fleet Commander Rear Admiral Mohsen Razzaqi has warned the US against any aggression, saying the country’s armed forces are at their highest level of coordination and naval units remain ready round the clock. His remarks come as Washington establishes Task Force Iron Gate to disrupt Iran’s alleged weapons supply routes across land borders and the Caspian Sea.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/enemy-will-no-longer-dare-attack-irans-navy-issues-warning-to-us-forces/articleshow/135651481.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/enemy-will-no-longer-dare-attack-irans-navy-issues-warning-to-us-forces/articleshow/135651481.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T10:10:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="ht