lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135649926.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Taiwan's Ministry of National Defence has observed a surge in Chinese military maneuvers surrounding the island, showcasing four separate sorties of aircraft and multiple naval vessels encroaching upon Taiwan's Air Defence Identification Zone. The Coast Guard has actively countered China's coast guard efforts, reaffirming Taiwan's sovereignty over its surrounding waters.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/taiwan-detects-4-chinese-military-aircraft-8-ships-around-island-in-24-hours/articleshow/135649926.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/taiwan-detects-4-chinese-military-aircraft-8-ships-around-island-in-24-hours/articleshow/135649926.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T08:35:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135649993,imgsize-78065.cms"/></item></channel></rss>